{"id":"c3641f7a442206b5","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-endomorphism-algebra.md","title":"Endomorphism (Substitution) on Formula Algebra","display":"df-endomorphism-algebra — Endomorphism (Substitution) on Formula Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-endomorphism-algebra","aliases":["57-df-endomorphism-algebra"],"display":"df-endomorphism-algebra — Endomorphism (Substitution) on Formula Algebra","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula-algebra]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-arity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-endomorphism-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-endomorphism-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-endomorphism-algebra — Endomorphism (Substitution) on Formula Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4829220d0330e683\" href=\"?note=4829220d0330e683\" title=\"57-df-formula-algebra\">57-df-formula-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)\">\\(I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i^{\\mathfrak F}=g(i)\">\\(f_i^{\\mathfrak F}=g(i)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4829220d0330e683\" href=\"?note=4829220d0330e683\" title=\"57-df-formula-algebra\">57-df-formula-algebra</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\mathrm{arity}\\upharpoonright I\">\\(\\tau=\\mathrm{arity}\\upharpoonright I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_i=\\tau(i)\">\\(n_i=\\tau(i)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a>；元数映射的输入是符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>，不是解释后的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\">\\(f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:F\\to F\">\\(\\sigma:F\\to F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{n_i}\\rangle\\in F^{n_i}\">\\(\\bar x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{n_i}\\rangle\\in F^{n_i}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(\\bar x)=\\langle\\sigma(x_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(x_{n_i})\\rangle\">\\(\\sigma(\\bar x)=\\langle\\sigma(x_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(x_{n_i})\\rangle\\)</span> 为逐分量作用，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^F\">\\(F^F\\)</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的函数集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}endomorphism\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak{F}_S) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \n\\left\\{ \\sigma \\in F^F \\;\\middle|\\; \\forall i \\in I\\; \\forall \\bar{x} \\in F^{n_i}\\; \\Big( \\sigma(f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(\\bar{x})) = f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(\\sigma(\\bar{x})) \\Big) \\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}endomorphism\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak{F}_S) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \n\\left\\{ \\sigma \\in F^F \\;\\middle|\\; \\forall i \\in I\\; \\forall \\bar{x} \\in F^{n_i}\\; \\Big( \\sigma(f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(\\bar{x})) = f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(\\sigma(\\bar{x})) \\Big) \\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}endomorphism\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\sigma \\in \\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak{F}_S) \\leftrightarrow (\\sigma: F \\to F) \\;\\land\\; \\forall i \\in I\\; \\forall x_1, \\dots, x_{n_i} \\in F\\; \\Big(\\sigma(f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(x_1, \\dots, x_{n_i})) = f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(\\sigma(x_1), \\dots, \\sigma(x_{n_i}))\\Big)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}endomorphism\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\sigma \\in \\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak{F}_S) \\leftrightarrow (\\sigma: F \\to F) \\;\\land\\; \\forall i \\in I\\; \\forall x_1, \\dots, x_{n_i} \\in F\\; \\Big(\\sigma(f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(x_1, \\dots, x_{n_i})) = f_i^{\\mathfrak{F}}(\\sigma(x_1), \\dots, \\sigma(x_{n_i}))\\Big)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","e